WEBVTT

00:00.240 --> 00:02.947
Your Highness, be prudent in all things.

00:06.120 --> 00:07.520
Rest assured.

00:17.960 --> 00:20.520
Stop pacing about—you're making my eyes dizzy.

00:21.960 --> 00:26.480
Or perhaps your venerable self could hire a Daoist priest to work a spell and conjure Yu Gong right out of the Imperial City Guard?

00:26.560 --> 00:28.000
Both of you, hold your tongues!

00:30.280 --> 00:31.680
Your Highness.

00:40.840 --> 00:43.800
Your Highness, tell us what happened that day.

00:46.400 --> 00:52.480
Yu Gong, Chancellor of the Imperial Academy, was like a mentor to me. That day, he invited me to meet his disciples.

00:52.560 --> 00:59.773
After a few rounds of wine, his spirits soared and he penned a passionate poem—exhorting us never to forget our vow to reclaim the sacred northern lands.

01:00.000 --> 01:06.000
Now, my elder brother and the Chen clan have twisted his verse, framing it as an incitement to treason.

01:06.400 --> 01:09.680
This is a catastrophe! What exactly did Yu Gong write?

01:10.120 --> 01:19.440
What he wrote no longer matters. Since Your Highness was present that day, the Prince of Ning and the Chen clan are determined to drag you down with him.

01:20.040 --> 01:30.600
Our urgent priority is to eliminate every witness who was at the tavern that day, sever all ties with Yu Gong, and ensure not a drop of this mud splatters upon you.

01:31.040 --> 01:35.000
Minister Xie rolls his tongue so effortlessly... just how many lives must be snuffed out?!

01:36.600 --> 01:43.400
Your Highness, Yu Gong enjoys immense prestige both within the Imperial Academy and among the common folk. He has recommended countless worthy talents to your service.

01:43.480 --> 01:47.200
If Your Highness abandons him now to save yourself, what will the realm's scholars think of you?

01:47.360 --> 01:56.720
Moreover, if you will not even protect your own loyal followers, what court minister would ever dare pledge their wholehearted allegiance to Your Highness again?

01:56.800 --> 02:00.840
A ruler of soft benevolence cannot survive in times of chaos. Your Highness's grand ambition is to reclaim our lost northern lands.

02:00.920 --> 02:08.160
If you dither over a single subordinate and sow discord between yourself and His Majesty, that would be a far greater disaster.

02:08.360 --> 02:12.560
Of course, the final decision rests solely with Your Highness.
